  "problemStatement": "Determine whether F = <2xy, x^2 + 2yz, y^2> is conservative by computing its curl.",
  "finalAnswer": "\\text{curl}\\,\\mathbf{F} = \\mathbf{0} \\implies \\mathbf{F} \\text{ is conservative}",
  "steps": [
